    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d746">

                <pb facs="0864" n="768" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg768"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Straus to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-07-25"><hi rendition="#italic">July 25,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Before the Turkish minister leaves impress upon him the imperative necessity
                    prompt payment indemnity according to Sultan’s promises last December.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Straus.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
